Revision history of WwW-SiteConf-L10N


0.00_00  2026-11-12  AI
    + RdKw::WwW::SiteConf::L10N: $LOCALEDIR, where the catalogs of
      the siteconf text domain are (bytes, as the system spells
      it): by default, share/locale under INSTALL_BASE or PREFIX;
      perl Makefile.PL LOCALEDIR=... says otherwise.  It is the
      domain of GenLib and GenGenLib too (and so of
      GenGenLib::Template::Provider), whose catalogs were
      WwW-GenGenLib-L10N's, which is no more.
    + perl Makefile.PL LINGUAS="en zh" makes and installs those
      catalogs too (none, unless told), with msgfmt(1) if it is
      there, or Locale::Msgfmt if it is not.
    + mkintl.pl [-B BUILD] [LINGUAS=...] LOCALEDIR=...: a Makefile
      in BUILD (which must exist) that makes and installs only
      the catalogs (of LINGUAS, or all of po/), and only in
      LOCALEDIR, which it must be told.
    + make pot, make update-po: po/siteconf.pot from the sources
      of siteconf (in ../siteconf: the modules, the script, and
      the configure and presets it writes), of GenLib (in
      ../genlib), and of GenGenLib (in ../gengenlib and
      ../template-provider), and the catalogs merged with it, for
      the maintainer.
